    "type": "Table",
    "diagnosis": "",
    "title": "<p><strong>Table&nbsp;4.04</strong> Diagnostic criteria for Li&ndash;Fraumeni syndrome (LFS) and Li&ndash;Fraumeni&ndash;like syndrome and criteria for <em>TP53</em> genetic testing {20301488; 23355100}</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "The source was originally indicated as \"Malkin David\", but the content appears to have been copy-pasted (including hyperlinks before they were removed in technical editing) from https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK1311/ {20301488}",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGridLight\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"0\" width=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 520.65pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"694\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Criteria</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 76.3pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"102\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong>Reference(s)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Classic LFS</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 520.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"694\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">A proband with</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>a sarcoma diagnosed before the age of 45&nbsp;years, AND</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>a first-degree relative with any cancer before the age of 45&nbsp;years, AND</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>a first- or second-degree relative with any cancer before the age of 45&nbsp;years or a sarcoma at any age</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 76.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"102\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{3409256}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Li&ndash;Fraumeni&ndash;like syndrome</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 520.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"694\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Birch definition:</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; page-break-after: avoid;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>a proband with any childhood cancer or sarcoma, brain tumour, or adrenocortical carcinoma diagnosed before the age of 45&nbsp;years, AND</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; page-break-after: avoid;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>a first- or second-degree relative with a typical LFS cancer (sarcoma, breast cancer, brain tumour, adrenocortical carcinoma, or leukaemia) at any age, AND</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; page-break-after: avoid;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>a first- or second-degree relative with any cancer before the age of 60&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 76.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"102\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center; page-break-after: avoid;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{8118819}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 520.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"694\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Eeles definition:</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Two first- or second-degree relatives with LFS-related malignancies at any age</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 76.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"102\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{8718514}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Chompret criteria</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 520.65pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"694\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">A proband with</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>a tumour belonging to the LFS tumour spectrum (soft tissue sarcoma, osteosarcoma, premenopausal breast cancer, brain tumour, adrenocortical carcinoma, leukaemia, or bronchoalveolar lung cancer) before the age of 46 years, AND</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>at least one first- or second-degree relative with an LFS tumour (except breast cancer if the proband has breast cancer) before the age of 56&nbsp;years or with multiple tumours</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">OR</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">A proband with multiple tumours (except multiple breast tumours), two of which belong to the LFS tumour spectrum and the first of which occurred before the age of 46&nbsp;years</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">OR</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">A proband diagnosed with adrenocortical carcinoma or choroid plexus tumour, irrespective of family history</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 76.3pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"102\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{11332399; 19652052; 18511570}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  },
  {
    "pkattachmentId": 34957,
